# HC-007 Fixed Packet

Use this exact packet in both conditions.

## Question

Trace the complete approval decision for `OrderAction.perform` when `op=approve`. Determine which checks are visible in the allowed source and which runtime facts remain unknown. Do not approve a business conclusion or edit code.

## Allowed source

- `wholesale-web/src/main/java/jp/co/tsubame/wholesale/web/action/OrderAction.java`
- `wholesale-core/src/main/java/jp/co/tsubame/wholesale/service/OrderService.java`
- `wholesale-core/src/main/java/jp/co/tsubame/wholesale/service/BaseService.java`
